{"seq":2,"slug":"recommendation-systems","title":"推荐系统中的序贯决策","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/reinforcement-learning-applied/applications/recommendation-systems","wordCount":1672,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"推荐系统中的序贯决策\">推荐系统中的序贯决策</h1><p>传统推荐系统将每次推荐视为独立的预测问题——预测用户对候选物品的即时点击概率，然后按分数排序。这种贪心策略忽略了一个关键事实：用户与平台的交互是一个<strong>序贯过程</strong>，今天的推荐会影响明天的用户状态。一味推送高点击率内容可能短期指标漂亮，却导致信息茧房、用户疲劳和长期留存下降。RL 为推荐系统提供了优化长期用户价值（LTV）的理论框架——将推荐决策建模为 MDP，显式考虑当前动作对未来状态的影响。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-推荐系统的-mdp-建模\">核心概念：推荐系统的 MDP 建模</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>MDP 元素</th>\n<th>推荐场景映射</th>\n<th>工程挑战</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>状态 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>用户画像 + 历史行为序列 + 上下文</td>\n<td>高维稀疏、实时变化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>动作 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>推荐列表/候选排序/展示策略</td>\n<td>组合爆炸（百万候选）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>转移 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>用户行为响应（点击/忽略/离开）</td>\n<td>部分可观测、随机性强</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>奖励 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>即时反馈 + 长期指标的加权组合</td>\n<td>延迟奖励、多目标冲突</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>折扣 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>长期价值衰减权重</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span></span></span></span></span> 决定优化视野长度</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    subgraph STATE[&quot;用户状态&quot;]&#10;        S1[&quot;用户画像&quot;]&#10;        S2[&quot;近期行为序列&quot;]&#10;        S3[&quot;实时上下文&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph POLICY[&quot;RL 推荐策略&quot;]&#10;        P1[&quot;候选召回&quot;]&#10;        P2[&quot;粗排&quot;]&#10;        P3[&quot;精排(RL 策略)&quot;]&#10;        P4[&quot;重排/多样性&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph REWARD[&quot;多目标奖励&quot;]&#10;        R1[&quot;即时点击&quot;]&#10;        R2[&quot;深度转化&quot;]&#10;        R3[&quot;用户留存&quot;]&#10;        R4[&quot;多样性/新鲜度&quot;]&#10;        R5[&quot;负反馈(疲劳/退订)&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    STATE --&gt; POLICY&#10;    POLICY --&gt; REWARD&#10;    REWARD --&gt;|&quot;反馈&quot;| STATE\">flowchart TD\n    subgraph STATE[\"用户状态\"]\n        S1[\"用户画像\"]\n        S2[\"近期行为序列\"]\n        S3[\"实时上下文\"]\n    end\n    subgraph POLICY[\"RL 推荐策略\"]\n        P1[\"候选召回\"]\n        P2[\"粗排\"]\n        P3[\"精排(RL 策略)\"]\n        P4[\"重排/多样性\"]\n    end\n    subgraph REWARD[\"多目标奖励\"]\n        R1[\"即时点击\"]\n        R2[\"深度转化\"]\n        R3[\"用户留存\"]\n        R4[\"多样性/新鲜度\"]\n        R5[\"负反馈(疲劳/退订)\"]\n    end\n    STATE --&gt; POLICY\n    POLICY --&gt; REWARD\n    REWARD --&gt;|\"反馈\"| STATE</pre><h2 id=\"离线-rl-在推荐中的优势\">离线 RL 在推荐中的优势</h2><p>推荐系统天然适合 Offline RL：平台积累了海量的用户-物品交互日志，这些日志就是 Offline RL 所需的历史轨迹数据集。相比在线 RL 的优势：</p>\n<p><strong>无探索风险</strong>：在线 RL 需要探索性推荐（可能推送不相关内容），直接影响用户体验和业务指标。Offline RL 从历史数据中学习，部署前通过 OPE 验证。</p>\n<p><strong>样本效率</strong>：推荐系统日活跃用户产生的行为日志可达数十亿条——这是 Offline RL 的理想数据规模。</p>\n<p><strong>安全的策略迭代</strong>：先离线训练 → OPE 评估 → 小流量 AB → 全量上线，每步都有退出机制。</p>\n<p><strong>实际部署的典型 Offline RL 框架</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>从用户行为日志构建 MDP 数据集（状态 = 用户特征 + 行为历史，动作 = 推荐内容，奖励 = 用户反馈）</li>\n<li>用 CQL / BCQ / IQL 训练离线策略</li>\n<li>FQE（Fitted Q Evaluation）离线评估策略价值</li>\n<li>小流量在线 AB 实验验证</li>\n<li>渐进放量</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"多目标奖励设计\">多目标奖励设计</h2><p>推荐系统的奖励设计是最核心也最复杂的工程决策：</p>\n<p><strong>即时 vs 长期的权衡</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>click</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>dwell</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>purchase</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>retention</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>5</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>fatigue</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r = w_1 \\cdot r_{\\text{click}} + w_2 \\cdot r_{\\text{dwell}} + w_3 \\cdot r_{\\text{purchase}} + w_4 \\cdot r_{\\text{retention}} - w_5 \\cdot r_{\\text{fatigue}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">click</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">dwell</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=